# .secrets-patterns.example — copy to .secrets-patterns (which is gitignored) and edit.
# One regular expression per line. Case-insensitive. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Put here every string that must never appear in a public commit.

# your real domains
example-domain\.com
admin\.example-domain\.com

# database name / user / host
u[0-9]{6,}_[a-z]+

# your email
you@example\.com

# real folder or customer names that would identify you
